  "summary": "pypdf has possible long runtimes when retrieving page labels",
  "details": "### Impact\n\nAn attacker who uses this vulnerability can craft a PDF which leads to large runtimes. This requires retrieving the page labels of a file.\n\n### Patches\n\nThis has been fixed in [pypdf==6.21.3](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/releases/tag/6.21.3).\n\n### Workarounds\n\nIf you cannot upgrade yet, consider applying the changes from PR [#4251](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/pull/4251).",
